WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:11.220
Elon Musk's Tesla Roadster is an electric sports car that served as the dummy payload for the February 2018 Falcon Heavy test flight and became an artificial satellite of the Sun.

00:11.772 --> 00:16.356
A mannequin in a spacesuit, dubbed "Starman", occupies the driver's seat.

00:16.785 --> 00:23.363
The car and rocket are products of Tesla and SpaceX, respectively, both companies headed by Elon Musk.

00:23.845 --> 00:29.110
Musk personally owned the 2010 Roadster and previously used it for commuting to work.

00:29.678 --> 00:32.558
It is the first production car launched into space.
